    text: "Final standalone results are recorded in docs/proposer-revert-evidence.json: packed process CLI reproduces ETIMEDOUT at its unchanged 20000 ms command limit; the canonical 512-card property and recoverable card transaction matrix each reproduce their unchanged 600000 ms parent limit. The transaction retry reports 133 tests: 124 pass, 7 failed-to-start after the parent finished, 2 cancellations, zero skip/todo. The packed LM command also reproduces ETIMEDOUT at 25000 ms and remains owned by pm-rl-7c7m. HTTP retry passed 1/1; callback log recovered 123/123 passes with recorder exit status unavailable after the provider interruption. Linked the already-executed process/card reproduction commands without rerunning them. Complete source-fix CI remains green across npm Node 22/26 and Bun Node 26 at original scope and thresholds."
