    text: "PR 145 replay review round 3 adds another unchanged-bound local timing receipt: Node 26 npm release passed 31/31 release-policy tests, then test/baseline.test.ts case refused vector retries converge at every collect train evaluate refusal and terminal boundary on one plain tracker reached its existing 600000 ms parent timeout. The full local command subsequently exhausted a 20-minute outer execution budget and has no completed coverage totals. No successful retry is claimed: the exact fix-head CI release matrix remains queued at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rl/actions/runs/42025105305 . The new replay-focused run passed 19/19 and restored behavioral revert controls passed 6/6. Preserve all existing test and coverage bounds; replay correctness remains tracked by pm-rl-proposer-program."
