    text: "Round 4 measures the unchanged 500-sequence test before/after retaining all SDK checks. Inputs and native-update draws stay in their original deterministic order; eight identity groups share one real tracker and one lease each. Added structural assertions for all 500 visited sequences, 2000 program operations, 500 native replays, 1000 native read-back checks, 20 native mutations and eight sessions. The existing 600-second parent timeout and all release thresholds remain unchanged. Baseline timing is running; direct release gates will use the CI runtime and isolated Git identity."
