    text: "Serial lease/workspace reuse alone still reached the unchanged 600000 ms parent bound under shared load: 2 focused tests, 1 pass (ordering), 0 fail, 1 model cancellation; total wall 606.34 seconds. Do not claim a runtime improvement from that attempt. Added at most two independent identity groups in flight within the same test process, using Promise.allSettled so every active lease finishes cleanup before propagating an error. Pure input/update generation remains ordered and all 500 native sequences plus assertions are preserved. Measuring this bounded IO overlap now."
  - created_at: "2026-11-05T14:45:09.145Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "The protected paired run also reached the 600-second bound (607.061 seconds total, ordering 1 pass, model 1 cancellation). Inspection found the added outer SDK scope supplied cwd, acquiring the SDK activation write gate while mutateLoopItem opens a nested path-only scope using its read gate. This test-only scope choice can block nested controller work and must not be attributed solely to host load. Removed outer cwd (clients already bind their real workspace and tracker), retaining the shared public read scope, and added per-group progress receipts. Measuring the corrected scope now; no production serializer or controller behavior changed."
