    text: "Completed before/after receipt: original model hits 600000 ms timeout (604.36 seconds total wall, zero pass, one cancellation); final model passes at 362.159370373 seconds (364.76 total wall including the ordering control), 2/2 focused tests, no failures/cancellations/skips. All 500 SDK sequences, 2000 program checks, 1000 read assertions, 20 mutations and 445 drift refusals remain; eight small real trackers/controller leases replace repeated controller setup against growing shared tracker state. Limit remains 600000 ms. Receipt: docs/proposer-review-round-4-evidence.json. Existing unrelated local gate timing cases remain open for orchestrator verification."
