    text: "Round-5 linked verification is complete: six commands report 166 tests, 165 passes and one existing packed-CLI subprocess ETIMEDOUT, with zero cancellations/skips/todo. The exact build-prefixed failed command passes its isolated retry (1/1) with fresh HOME and no global/system Git configuration; loop duration 10923.591211 ms stays below the unchanged 20000 ms CLI limit. Card property passes 1/1; recoverable card transactions pass 145/145; 500-sequence model passes 1/1 with every native counter retained; cleanup/HTTP recovery passes 4/4; bandit smoke passes 14/14. All six commands now have passing evidence. Existing authored limits are unchanged. Exact commands, counts, initial failure, retry and 12 behavioral revert proofs are in docs/proposer-review-round-5-evidence.json. Full npm Node 22/26 and Bun Node 26 gates are delegated to fresh final-head CI at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rl/pull/145/checks . Keep the timing follow-up in progress for orchestrator verification; release only this agent claim."
