    text: "Final corrected-head CI proof: 2621012592d5ea582c54f5af7b61e585ee151b2e, run https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rl/actions/runs/43806078756 completed success at 2026-11-16 05:07:30 UTC, before the 05:16:15 UTC observation deadline. All ten jobs succeeded. Jobs API execution wall seconds: quick-shard (22, 1) 878; quick-shard (22, 2) 724; coverage-shard (26, 1) 227; coverage-shard (26, 2) 432; coverage-shard (26, 3) 566; coverage-shard (26, 4) 518; release-checks (26) 36; coverage-merge 28; test (22) 26; test (26) 2. Every job met <=15 minutes and the 22-minute cap. Merged coverage: 64 required source files, lines/branches/functions/statements each 100.00%, unchanged thresholds and scope. CodeQL also passed. Queue delay is excluded from execution times; end-to-end workflow latency was 21m09s."
