    text: "Final delivery: 829fef3 implements four raw-hit coverage shards, exact Node-native merge with existing gate enforcement, parallel non-coverage release checks, fail-closed required aggregate, no-build docs/tracker path and workflow/merge fixtures. Thread PRRT_kwDOTqJmqs63vkcK maps to 829fef3 plus corrective 2621012; thread PRRT_kwDOTqJmqs63vkcO maps to 829fef3. No thread/bot reply, resolution or reaction. Local proof: typecheck, test typecheck, lint, duplicates, docstring, identity, changelog and strict health passed; harness 104/104 via pm test, touched suites 115/115 direct, corrective proof/workflow 11/11, Node 26 shard/CLI fixtures 2/2. The pm wrapper sandbox collision/refused retry are recorded separately. Local release:check and ci-deep unchanged; full-depth/Docker were not rerun. Docs-only behavior has contract proof but no separate docs-only hosted PR run. All-PR base-to-head classification means pushing a tracker-only receipt here would rerun code CI; final task/history receipt is committed locally without another push, preserving measured remote head 2621012. PR body carries all job times and coverage. Releasing without closing."
