    text: "Round K: the three shared defect classes do not apply to the current merge implementation. collectSources/parseLcov normalize separators; raw replay stores and rewrites file URLs through pathToFileURL, without URL.pathname filesystem access. The existing oracle saves native unsharded LCOV and V8 statement coverage before the shard/replay path. Extended that independent fixture to src/source.ts inside a checkout containing spaces and verified replay into a relocated checkout. Required pm test gate passed: npm run typecheck && npm run build:test && npm run lint && node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/coverage-gate.test.ts test/ci-workflow.test.ts test/release-workflow.test.ts && git diff --check. 73 tests passed, zero failed/skipped. PR #180 was open when inspected; recheck before push. Project test-result tracking is disabled; this comment retains results. No thread mutations. Releasing in progress for orchestrator verification."
