    text: "PRRT_kwDOTqJmqs630k0X is valid: updated linked test 21 using pm test --update-index 21 --set-json to pm_context_mode none and workspace_context_mode snapshot. pm test --run --only-index 21 --progress passed: typecheck, build:test, lint and 73 workflow/coverage tests with zero failures/skips. Tracking is disabled, so this comment records the receipt. PRRT_kwDOTqJmqs630k0b is valid: replace filesystem URL.pathname uses with fileURLToPath, including the additional matches in tests and fixtures. Add a real controller regression through a checkout path containing spaces."
