    text: "Correction to the earlier progress note: pm test rejects changing a command with --set-json because commands are immutable identities. Replaced row 22 atomically with --remove-index plus --add-json, preserving its timeout and snapshot/none context metadata. Inspection also found doubled regexp escapes in the old selector: it did not match the named live prefix acceptance at all. Normalized those escapes without changing the intended case names. The first, unmodified run was stopped; it is not passing evidence. The generated dist remains moved aside for the corrected run."
